                [
                    1038.0,
                    329.0
                ],
                [
                    1038.0,
                    415.0
                ],
                [
                    172.0,
                    415.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.2 Release Time:",
            "block_bbox": [
                175,
                436,
                393,
                465
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    175.0,
                    436.0
                ],
                [
                    393.0,
                    436.0
                ],
                [
                    393.0,
                    465.0
                ],
                [
                    175.0,
                    465.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. United Academics may purchase the release of up to 48 workload units per semester upon payment to the University for the released portion of each unit member's salary and benefits. United Academics may distribute release time in any combination of workload units to unit members.",
            "block_bbox": [
                245,
                488,
                1040,
                601
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    245.0,
                    488.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    488.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    601.0
                ],
                [
                    245.0,
                    601.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. United Academics shall notify the University no later than March 15 as to the unit members who are to receive releases during the subsequent academic year. In exceptional circumstances, changes may be made by United Academics no less than 60 days prior to the beginning of a semester.",
            "block_bbox": [
                245,
                622,
                1040,
                762
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    245.0,
                    622.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    622.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    762.0
                ],
                [
                    245.0,
                    762.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Payment to the University for released time must be made prior to the release of a unit member, upon presentation by the University of a billing statement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                245,
                785,
                1033,
                869
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    245.0,
                    785.0
                ],
                [
                    1033.0,
                    785.0
                ],
                [
                    1033.0,
                    869.0
                ],
                [
                    245.0,
                    869.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The University may, at its discretion, substitute other unit members or non-unit members to perform the portions of the workloads from which unit members have been released. Funds remaining after substitute credit hours have been paid shall be used for faculty development. The parties shall meet and confer regarding the distribution of these funds.",
            "block_bbox": [
                244,
                891,
                1037,
                1032
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    244.0,
                    891.0
                ],
                [
                    1037.0,
                    891.0
                ],
                [
                    1037.0,
                    1032.0
                ],
                [
                    244.0,
                    1032.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.3 United Academics shall provide the University with a list of names, official addresses, and phone numbers of the duly certified officers and all representatives, and maintain that list's currency.",
            "block_bbox": [
                175,
                1053,
                983,
                1138
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    175.0,
