        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.6 The University shall provide two offices for use by United Academics, one at UAA and the other at UAF, upon payment of $5,000 by United Academics to the University no later than September 1 of each academic year. The office space currently occupied by United Academics at UAA and UAF will continue to be",
